<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Alex. Brown cuts May &amp; Speh.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Alex. Brown cuts May &amp; Speh.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons analyst Chris Feiss said he cut May &amp; Speh Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 to 8-5/8 in early trading Friday.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
